WEBVTT

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.200
Good thing it's sunny today, huh?

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.370
I'm Ai Ohto.

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.240
Your clothes are cute.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.830
Where do you shop?

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:40.740
Really, though, the weather is great.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.450
Isn't it hard to protect a lot of Eggs?

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.040
Is there a trick to it?

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.200
These snacks are really good.

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:04.200
Can I ask you a question, too?

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:08.830
Of course! Ask me anything!

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:16.660
Who are you fighting for?

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:19.410
For Koito, of course!

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.240
Who's Koito?

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:23.580
My friend.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:24.910
I see.

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:29.040
You're sure it's not for yourself?

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.200
What do you mean?

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:34.450
You don't like who you are now, so you go.

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:36.240
Even if you're scared.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:39.080
You want to change the self you hate.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.200
You, too?

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.200
I'm not like you. I love myself.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.450
Why do you do it, then?

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.330
For my sister.

00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:51.410
Your sister?

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.330
I let her die.

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:06.950
Wonder Egg Priority

00:03:27.490 --> 00:03:30.620
Episode 2: 'The Terms of Friendship'

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:30.620
I'm home.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.700
Welcome home,

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:37.830
Ai.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:42.040
Ohto,

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:44.990
do your injuries feel all right now?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.700
Your mother is worried.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:52.790
Won't you tell me what happened to you?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.160
Ai!

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.540
Ma'am.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.330
I'm sorry.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:05.200
Do you hate me that much?

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.620
Not really.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.830
I don't hate you.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:13.200
I'm glad.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.490
You can't say that!

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:24.490
Here's my contact info.

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:27.080
Message me when you want to change plans.

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:31.290
I'll buy Eggs on odd days;
you buy them on even days.

00:04:28.540 --> 00:04:29.240
Huh?!

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.580
We won't have to meet again.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.200
Good luck.

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:45.080
Don't misuse my contact info.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:50.240
Neiru

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.240
As if.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.910
So,

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:21.870
as long as I don't crack the Egg,
nothing will happen.

00:05:21.870 --> 00:05:24.700
They don't attack me, after all.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:05:59.740
Okay.

00:05:59.740 --> 00:06:01.080
Umm...

00:06:03.490 --> 00:06:05.700
Sorry, talk later!

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:06.790
Huh?

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:07.990
Run!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:12.080
Umm, what's going on?

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:15.990
Is this... a school?

00:06:15.990 --> 00:06:17.790
Hey, where are you going?!

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:22.330
Ow...

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.490
You okay?

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:27.870
Hey, wait!

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:29.910
I'll protect you!

00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:42.740
Thank you.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:50.910
This way!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.450
Go in there!

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:05.290
I think that should buy us some time.

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:07.740
Sorry to spring that on you. I'm--

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.950
Are you okay?

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:17.080
I'm Ai Ohto.

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:19.160
Minami Suzuhara.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.410
Don't worry.

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.990
I'll protect you to save Koito.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.790
Koito?

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:30.870
She's your friend?

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:32.620
Yup.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:37.080
I'm jealous. I wish I had friends.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:42.080
Huh?! Umm...

00:07:43.080 --> 00:07:45.580
So, why a leotard?

00:07:45.580 --> 00:07:46.790
Huh? Umm...

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:49.040
I'm in the gymnastics club.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.160
I knew it!

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:53.160
You've got a great figure. I'm jealous.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:59.450
The coach was always
yelling at me to maintain it.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:03.490
I'm a shut-in, so my legs are all puffy.

00:08:03.490 --> 00:08:05.240
You're a shut-in?

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:07.830
Yup. I'm hopeless.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:10.700
Wow.

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:11.580
Huh?

00:08:11.580 --> 00:08:14.910
I wish I had your spirit and guts.

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:16.990
Wh-What do you mean?

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:22.290
One time, I made up my mind
to skip morning practice.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:23.490
Yeah?

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:25.370
I wanted to stay in bed.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.080
I know that feeling.

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:30.870
I wanted to see what morning rush hour was like.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:32.290
Oh.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:36.330
But, maybe because I psyched
myself up, I couldn't sleep all night.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:37.540
Oh, yeah!

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:40.080
Like when you wake up and it's already evening!

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:44.620
In the end, I went to morning
practice without sleeping.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.950
I was out of it from my all-nighter,

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:50.410
so the coach really let me have it.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:55.580
I think that's way more
impressive than anything I do.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.740
If only I were strong like you, Ohto.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.910
Don't worry.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:05.330
I'll protect you, so let's survive together.

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:05.770
Yes.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.830
It will take more than that
to bring your friend back.

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:11.040
Huh?

00:09:11.040 --> 00:09:12.700
Oh, it's kind of...

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:15.700
Here I am. Over here.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.660
To free the captured maiden,

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.330
you have to beat the Wonder Killer.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.620
What does that mean?

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:28.450
I thought it would be easier
to understand if they had a name.

00:09:28.450 --> 00:09:31.120
Don't we just have to survive?!

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.700
How is just running away
supposed to solve anything?

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:38.410
Stand and fight, young lady!

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.580
Stand and fight what?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:44.740
A Wonder Killer is the form of an Egg's trauma.

00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:47.160
The two are drawn to each other.

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:51.120
To take down a Wonder Killer,
you need... your...

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:53.700
What? Hello?

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:52.730
U-Umm...

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:56.910
I hear something from the other side of the...

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.410
Is that delinquent rubbing off on you?

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.410
I only took my eyes off you for a minute.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.120
Who's this lady?

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:10.450
Don't slack off, Suzuhara. Practice.

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:11.910
Speak up!

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.790
I'm sorry, Coach!

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.950
C-Coach?!

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:18.120
This is her trauma?!

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:22.160
You mean my teaching? Nonsense.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.330
Stay away from Minami.

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:25.490
Now I'm really--

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:26.790
No!

00:10:26.790 --> 00:10:28.870
It's because I'm no good.

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:29.700
Huh?

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:33.540
That's right. It's because
you don't have enough spirit.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.620
I'm sorry. I'll try harder.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:37.990
What do you mean?

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:40.700
Wasn't that so hard you couldn't take it?

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:45.410
Coach says she does it for me,
because I'm gutless.

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:50.490
Mi...

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:53.370
Minami, get away from her!

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.830
I'll...

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.700
Minami...

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.200
I'll...

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.910
Oh, no. What happened?

00:11:09.910 --> 00:11:12.410
Classic harassment.

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.870
Why would they do this to you?

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.620
Because you're my friend?

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.830
That's not it.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:21.790
They say Mr. Sawaki
is giving me special treatment.

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:24.290
I think they're jealous.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:27.200
Of course he is. You're a transfer student.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.830
A woman's jealousy sure is scary, huh?

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.660
This isn't funny.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.290
Hey, this is wicked.

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:39.120
Hey, face this way.

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:39.920
Please, stop.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.240
Hey.

00:11:46.120 --> 00:11:47.540
Are you okay?

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.330
Did you get the video?

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:08.160
I'm sorry. I was scared.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.540
Scared of being left out.

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.740
You were scared, huh?

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:15.740
Sorry.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:17.080
I'm so sorry.

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:18.330
It's fine.

00:12:18.330 --> 00:12:20.990
I know you tried your best.

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:27.290
I'm sorry.

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.740
I feel sorry for Minami.

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:41.040
What's so strong about you?

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.450
Shut up.

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:45.830
I'm going

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.330
to change.

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:55.540
That's what's wrong with you.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.370
Your figure changed on your period?

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:59.910
Take gymnastics seriously, damn it!

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:02.790
I'm sorry. Please forgive me.

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.660
Just so you know,
this isn't corporal punishment.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:10.240
It's tough love. I do it because I love you.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:13.160
Yes, Coach.

00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:17.450
Once you're a good girl,

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:21.080
I'll make sure to finish you off painlessly.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.450
Thank you very much.

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:27.330
Ohto?!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:32.080
Enough is enough, you old bitch!

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:44.540
Stop!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.580
It's my fault!

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:48.580
Leave me alone!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:53.450
I don't have enough spirit or guts,
and I'm ugly and timid.

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.490
It's all my fault.

00:13:55.490 --> 00:13:57.020
So...

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:58.020
So...

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.790
You just want attention!

00:14:00.790 --> 00:14:05.870
What you really mean is that you want
someone to find you and love you!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.790
So, I won't leave you alone!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.910
I <i>can't</i> leave you alone!

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.040
Keep your mouth shut, brat!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.450
Shut up, bitch!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.660
You're interrupting practice!

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:32.490
You annoying fly.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.490
Please stop, Coach!

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:38.910
I'll do what you say!

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:41.290
I'll do anything!

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:47.370
Minami...

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.160
Oh, for the love of...

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:04.160
You're all hopeless!

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:08.330
My ribbon.

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:10.700
All right!

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:12.080
I can fight with this!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.660
How do you like this, then?

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:17.990
What is this stuff? I can't see.

00:15:17.990 --> 00:15:19.450
It's over.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:20.740
Jump!

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:26.620
Dodge right!

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:28.200
She'll come from behind!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.740
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.830
Are you disobeying me?

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.990
Are you going to betray me?

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:42.370
Betray my tough love?

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.910
I won't know if you don't speak up!

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:48.830
Well? Are you going to disobey me?

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:53.160
Answer me, Suzuhara!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.120
Here.

00:15:54.120 --> 00:15:55.830
I'm right here.

00:16:01.580 --> 00:16:03.040
Stupid brats!

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:06.790
I've got clout with the association!

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.990
They even consult me

00:16:08.990 --> 00:16:10.830
when they pick competitors!

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:13.830
So...

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:17.700
So what, you asshole?!

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:19.410
It's tough love!

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:20.540
Dodge!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:23.990
Sorry,

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:29.290
but that's just abuse!

00:16:29.290 --> 00:16:32.580
Now I'm really mad!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:35.740
Goodbye, Coach!

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:49.700
Minami!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:50.990
Are you okay?!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.660
Thank you, Ai.

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:00.200
It's thanks to you and your ribbon.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:03.450
You were really brave.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.660
Yeah.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:08.700
I wish I'd met you sooner, Ai.

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.040
Yeah.

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:14.990
If I had, we'd have chatted over burgers
and played games and things.

00:17:14.990 --> 00:17:17.950
Like normal girls.

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:19.370
Yeah.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:28.290
Will you remember me sometimes?

00:17:28.290 --> 00:17:29.740
Minami?

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.870
Damn it.

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:05.620
Is one enough for you?

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:10.040
You're prudent, unlike Neiru.

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:12.040
Haste makes waste.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:14.240
Did she die?

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:15.740
I don't know.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:22.740
There's no point going to save
someone if she gets herself killed.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:24.910
What do you know about it?!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.240
It's her sister.

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.910
Neiru is going to save her little sister.

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:31.410
She wants to save her quickly.

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:32.990
I wonder about that.

00:18:32.990 --> 00:18:36.370
Maybe she really wants to die, too.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:36.920
Huh?

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.740
That's why she's fearless.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.990
It's because you got greedy

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:28.450
It's because you got greedy

00:19:26.870 --> 00:19:28.450
When you get back next time,

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:35.700
When you get back next time,

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:35.700
let's be friends

00:19:35.990 --> 00:19:38.370
What are you doing?

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:40.290
Oh, sorry.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:51.740
Are you recovering okay?

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:53.540
I guess.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:54.990
I'm glad.

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:59.620
What would we do if we were friends?

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:03.200
We could go to a burger place.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:05.040
And then what?

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:10.120
You and I would eat.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.790
Fries, burgers, that kind of thing.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:16.990
We'd both eat them together, at the same table.

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:20.790
Is that fun?

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:24.910
I wonder.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:25.990
Here.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.620
Thanks.

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:38.240
This smells amazing!

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.700
You're right.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.080
Right?

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:58.330
Maybe once in a while.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:20:59.490
Hm?

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:01.940
Next time

00:22:58.410 --> 00:23:01.910
To be continued.
